# The gantry link (shared/comps/gantry.c, portal line glink): laser3015's Y
# drives at the default current loop, which made them fight at 200 Hz
# (portal_retrofit_fight.test), here with each other's position error and
# velocity over the simulated link (600 us, every 400 us), the yaw's
# velocity gain at r_vel 0.4: a slow pass stays clean and a 1 g move keeps
# the bridge square. Then the link off: the fight is back.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/laser3015_glink.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.5 750 1400
run 0.3
mark
move 4 750 1480
print max_cur_y1
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 < 1.6
run 0.2
mark
trapfrac 0.25
tmove 0.327 750 1680
run 0.4
print max_rack fault_code
@expect portal.max_rack < 15
@expect portal.fault_code == 0
glink off
run 0.2
mark
move 4 750 1600
print max_cur_y2
@expect portal.max_cur_y2 > 3
@reject ^ERROR
